  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for Enhancing Border Management Capacity for Responding to the Public Health Crises Including COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide necessary public health equipment and infrastructure and training for border authorities and users including border communities on usage and maintenance of equipment provided as well as on standard operating procedures for COVID-19 response at points of entry.</narrative>
  </description>
